<title>USA: Atria Communities Inc Q1 net lower.</title>
<headline>Atria Communities Inc Q1 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATRIA COMMUNITIES, INC.</p>
<p>  (Unaudited)				     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							    March 31,</p>
<p>							  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenues				    $14,217,000  $12,611,000</p>
<p> Net income				    1,578,000    1,166,000</p>
<p> Earnings per common share (a)		  0.10	   0.11</p>
<p>Shares used in computing earnings</p>
<p>  per common share (a)		    15,987,000   10,095,000</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Share and per share amounts for the three months ended March 31, 1996 are presented on a pro forma basis since Atria was a wholly-owned subsidiary of Vencor Inc prior to an initial public offering of 5.8 million shares in August 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
